import Mathlib
import PEqualNP.Defs

-- The search and its soundness proof are from rlanday's checked L-meta-982, PR 7614.
-- The cofactor bounds reuse the checked L-meta-982 and L-meta-5456 proofs.
-- Inputs four and five have identical neighborhoods and no edge between them.
-- Setting one of them to false leaves a six-input graph and removes at least one gate.
-- The six-input lower bound reuses the stock tagged search with this graph's truth table.

namespace PEqualNP.Outside.L_meta_10736_aux

namespace CheckedSearch
